{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModalContainer","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ModalContainer","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"WorkflowModals"}],"externalID":"s:14WorkflowModals14ModalContainerV","title":"ModalContainer"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/10WorkflowUI6ScreenP","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/10WorkflowUI22SingleScreenContainingP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/init(base:modals:)-8z69p","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/init(base:modals:)-9lnh9"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/base","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/modals"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/Screen-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/Screen-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer\/SingleScreenContaining-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorkflowModals\/documentation\/WorkflowModals\/ModalContainer","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Use a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ModalContainer"},{"text":" to render a base screen and an array of modals on top of it.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declaratio